        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Emtek 5115ROU, Keyed Modern Round Knob with Disk Rosette</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Modern Keyed Knob with Round Rosette is a sleek, contemporarily styled knobset that is a great choice for almost any chic home. It is available in a keyed entry function and also a non-active dummy function. The keyed entry is operated by a key from the exterior and a thumbturn from the interior. The Keyed Modern Round Knob with Disk Rosette will fit 1-1/4 inch to 2-3/4 inch thick doors and has an optional latch to accommodate either a 2-3/4 inch or a 2-3/8 inch backset. Choose from several beautifully modern finishes. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features and Specifications</b> for the Emtek Modern Round with Round Rose:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Knob Diameter: 2-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Knob Projection: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Diameter: 2-3/4</li>\r\n<li>Rose Thickness: 3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Doors Thickness: 1-1/4\" - 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Keyway: Schlage C</li>\r\n<li>Will fit standard 2-1/8\" door preparations.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available Functions</b> \r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Keyed Entry (Keyed Lock):</b> Use when a keyed lock is needed. The lock is operated by a key from the exterior and a thumbturn on the knob from the interior. Complete set - 2 knobs, 2 roses, keys, door latch, and strike plate.\r\n<li><b>Dummy:</b> Trim for non-working doors. It does not latch and does not lock. Usually used as matching trim for the non-working side of double doors.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-modern-levers-Finishes.jpg?v=1704354533\" width=\"599\" height=\"111\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Emtek Finish Chart\">\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Modern Keyed Knob with Round Rosette",
                "description": "The Modern Keyed Knob with Round Rosette is a sleek, contemporarily styled knobset that is a great choice for almost any chic home. It is available in a keyed entry function and also a non-active dummy function. The keyed entry is operated by a key from the exterior and a thumbturn from the interior. The Keyed Modern Round Knob with Disk Rosette will fit 1-1/4 inch to 2-3/4 inch thick doors and has an optional latch to accommodate either a 2-3/4 inch or a 2-3/8 inch backset. Choose from several beautifully modern finishes.",
